            "description_html": "<b>Deltana KC20U32D, 3/4\" Stainless Steel Retro Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful cabinet knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes a screw for easy installation. The 3/4 Inch Satin Stainless Steel Retro Cabinet Knob is reminiscent of retro 50's and 60's decor. Good for use on cabinet doors, furniture, or cabinet drawers. It is made out of Stainless Steel so it will look great for years to come.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-KC20-Specifications.gif?v=1704354521\" width=\"290\" height=\"179\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana KC20 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other finishes <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-3-4-inch-retro-cabinet-knob-deltana-kc20\"><b>Solid Brass Retro Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana KC20U32D Retro Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Diameter at Base: 1/2\"</li> -->\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/KC20.pdf?v=1704262158\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana KC20 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
